<title>JAPAN: Daiei OMC -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiei OMC -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenue	     44.81		vs	   44.78</p>
<p> Operating     loss 5.74		vs     prft 2.08</p>
